$MDESC::Type = "TAC";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> TAC Defend & Destroy" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Priam III" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Haze" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes are battling on the remote planet of Priam III.  The outposts are the target of each team with the distruction of the enemy generators the object of there fury. The generators are worth 50 points each and the towers between the outposts are worth 10 points each.The first tribe to reach 90 points either by destruction of the generators and capturing the towers and/or by the accumulation of points by enemy APC destruction will own Priam III" @
	 "\n\n<f1>For the TAC Mod:<f0> www.tribes-universe.com/tac/" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map designed by:<f0> [TPG]SaNTa[DTM]";
